The following description is about the account payable process. It begins when you file a copy for internal records. 
When filing a copy for internal records is completed, you need to create a receiving report.
Once creating a receiving report occurs, one or more of the following paths should be executed: gathering the receiving report, confirming all documents have been amended. 
Afterwards, you need to schedule the payment.
